eal data perimeter strategy.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Roi<br>Panai        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/aws-sign-in-vs-microsoft-conditional-access/","retrieved":1783372242198},{"title":"AWS Just Made Console Access Part of the Security Perimeter. Now Teams Need a Safe Way to Manage It","contents":"<article class=\"blog-filter-item card-block\">\n        <!-- Thumbnail -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__image-wrapper\">\n                            <figure class=\"blog-filter-item__image-figure\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20574'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"AWS Logo\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely.jpg 1344w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network%E2%80%A8Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-1024x574.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network%E2%80%A8Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"AWS Logo\" srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network&#8232;Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network&#8232;Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network&#8232;Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Restrict-Console-Access-by-Network&#8232;Learn-How-to-Enforce-It-Safely.jpg 1344w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript>                </figure>\n                    </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__content\">\n            <!-- Meta: Categories + Read Time -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__meta\">\n                                    <div class=\"blog-filter-item__categories\">\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AWS Guardrails                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Cloud Governance                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Native Controls                            </span>\n                                            </div>\n                \n                <span class=\"blog-filter-item__read-time\">\n                    2 min read                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h3 class=\"blog-filter-item__title\">\n                AWS Just Made Console Access Part of the Security Perimeter. Now Teams Need a Safe Way to Manage It            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Excerpt -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__excerpt\">\n                AWS Sign-In now enforces network-based console access. What changed, and how to enforce it safely across the organization without locking anyone out.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ROI-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"ROI\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Roi<br>Panai        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/aws-console-access-network-enforcement/","retrieved":1783041018382},{"title":"Why Cloud Security Visibility Isn’t Enough (The Prevention Gap)","contents":"<article class=\"blog-filter-item card-block\">\n        <!-- Thumbnail -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__image-wrapper\">\n                            <figure class=\"blog-filter-item__image-figure\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20574'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"Two tablet shown one is named The Placebo and other The Real Thing\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3.jpg 1344w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"blog-filter-item__image wp-post-image\" alt=\"Two tablet shown one is named The Placebo and other The Real Thing\" srcset=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-1024x574.jpg 1024w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-300x168.jpg 300w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3-768x430.jpg 768w, https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Placebo-Effect-of-Cloud-Security-Visibility-3.jpg 1344w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript>                </figure>\n                    </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"blog-filter-item__content\">\n            <!-- Meta: Categories + Read Time -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__meta\">\n                                    <div class=\"blog-filter-item__categories\">\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                AI Agents                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Cloud Defense                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Native Controls                            </span>\n                                                    <span class=\"blog-filter-item__category\">\n                                Preemptive Defense                            </span>\n                                            </div>\n                \n                <span class=\"blog-filter-item__read-time\">\n                    3 min read                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h3 class=\"blog-filter-item__title\">\n                Why Cloud Security Visibility Isn’t Enough (The Prevention Gap)            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Excerpt -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__excerpt\">\n                As cloud change accelerates and agent-driven actions reshape risk, visibility alone is no longer enough. Complementing the visibility-based operating model with prevention is the next must-have step for security teams that need to stop critical risks from materializing in the first place.            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"blog-filter-item__footer\">\n                \n<div class=\"post-author\">\n    <div class=\"post-author__avatar\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2050%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Dayana Nevo Blast\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\" data-lazy-src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dayana-Nevo-Blast-scaled.jpg\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://blast.security/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dayana-Nevo-Blast-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Dayana Nevo Blast\" width=\"50\" class=\"avatar avatar-50 photo\"></noscript>    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-author__info\">\n        <span class=\"post-author__name\">\n            Dayana<br>Nevo        </span>\n\n            </div>\n\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>","link":"https://blast.security/blog/visibility-to-prevention-cloud-security/","retrieved":1782727605613}]}